# Build output
/ic10c
/dist/
*.exe

# Go test artifacts
*.test
*.out
coverage.txt

# Generated one-time loaders: `ic10c build` writes <file>.data.ic next to the
# source (split into <file>.data.1.ic, .2.ic, ... when >128 lines).
*.data.ic
*.data.[0-9]*.ic

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Third-party content (not licensed for redistribution, kept locally only)
/Stationeers_IC10_参考文档.md
/testdata/screenshot/
/experiments/data-segment/barsiel_*.icg
/experiments/data-segment/ingame-airlock/*.ic

# Local design notes (not distributed)
/docs/architecture-improvement-plan.md

# ic10code/: only the author's own (Chinese-named) scripts are tracked;
# the rest is third-party community code kept locally only.
/ic10code/**
!/ic10code/太阳能追日与发电机控制.ic
!/ic10code/太阳能追日与发电机控制.icg
!/ic10code/温室照明与通风过滤.ic
!/ic10code/温室照明与通风过滤.icg
!/ic10code/氧气过滤灌装.ic
!/ic10code/氧气过滤灌装.icg
!/ic10code/逻辑分拣器分拣矿石.ic
!/ic10code/逻辑分拣器分拣矿石.icg

# Stationeers-Workspace corpus (StormCircuit): the raw third-party .ic10 files
# are kept locally only; the hand-written .icg ports are tracked.
!/ic10code/stationeers-workspace/
!/ic10code/stationeers-workspace/**
/ic10code/stationeers-workspace/**/*.ic10

# GitHub corpus: raw third-party .ic/.ic10 files are kept locally only; the
# hand-written .icg ports are tracked.
!/ic10code/github/
!/ic10code/github/**
/ic10code/github/**/*.ic10
/ic10code/github/**/*.ic
